// The international organizations of 1 January 2024 other than the two defence blocs, which
// are written with the alliances in 00_pacts. Membership is as it stood that morning:
//
// - the African Union with Mali, Burkina Faso, Niger, Guinea, Gabon and Sudan suspended after
//   their coups;
// - ECOWAS before the three Sahel juntas announced their exit (28 January 2024), Guinea suspended;
// - BRICS the day Egypt, Ethiopia, Iran and the United Arab Emirates joined; Saudi Arabia had not
//   answered the invitation;
// - OPEC after Angola left (1 January 2024);
// - Mercosur with Venezuela suspended and Bolivia not yet a full member (July 2024);
// - the SCO before Belarus (July 2024);
// - the CIS with Moldova still formally a member.
//
// A charter is what the organization does in the game (common/organizations): "development"
// for the economic unions with a common budget, "cooperation" for the councils and forums.
// "doctrine": "common_market" makes one a customs union from the first day - the EU, the Gulf
// Cooperation Council (2003), Mercosur, the Eurasian Economic Union, ECOWAS's common external
// tariff (2015): its members buy from each other first and from outside it less.
